### ===================================================================
### EMOTION MATRIX MICROSERVICES - HTTP REQUESTS TEST SUITE
### ===================================================================

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. API GATEWAY (Port 8000)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### 1a. Process Direct Text Message (Agent or Caller)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/process-message
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "I am extremely unhappy and I want to cancel my account immediately.",
  "speaker": "caller"
}

### 1b. Process Direct Text Message (Agent Response)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/process-message
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "I completely understand your concern and I am happy to help resolve this for you right away.",
  "speaker": "agent"
}

### 1c. Process Audio Payload (Base64 WAV/MP3)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/process-audio
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "audio_data": "//NkxAAAAANIAAAAAExBTUVVVVVMQU1FMy4xMDBVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVVV==",
  "speaker": "caller"
}


